## Quick Start

```bash
# Install
brew install manwithacat/tap/dazzle   # macOS/Linux (auto-registers MCP server)
# or: pip install dazzle-dsl

# Run the example
cd examples/simple_task
dazzle serve

# Open http://localhost:3000 for the UI
# Open http://localhost:8000/docs for the API
```

